                  "disabled": false,
                  "key": "grant_type",
                  "value": "<string>",
                  "description": "The grant type. Supported values:\n- `authorization_code`: The authorization code grant type.\n- `password`: The password grant type.\n- `urn:ietf:params:oauth:grant-type:saml2-bearer`: The saml2-bearer grant type.\n- `urn:visier:params:oauth:grant-type:asid-token`: The ASID token grant type."
